<前言><![CDATA[]]></前言>
<法規內容>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 1</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[These Standards are promulgated according to Article 92 of the Telecommunications Management Act (hereinafter referred to as the Act).]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 2</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[With regard to applications for radio frequency allocation review by telecommunications enterprises according to Paragraph 1, Article 53 of the Act, the review fees are as follows:
1. Mobile communications frequency allocation: NT$1 million per piece.
2. Satellite communications frequency allocation:
(1) For newly established satellite systems: NT$1 million per piece. The same shall apply to applications for both fixed-satellite and mobile-satellite services under the same satellite system.
(2) For existing satellite systems applying for additional frequency purposes: NT$1 million per piece.
(3) For existing satellite systems applying for additional or modified frequencies or installation sites without adding new frequency purposes: NT$200,000 per piece. If additional or modified frequency bands are involved, NT$500,000 per piece.
(4) Application for allocation of originally assigned frequencies upon expiry of the frequency use period: NT$5,000 per piece.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 3</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Applicants who have paid the fees as stipulated in these Standards may not request a refund, except in the case of overpayment, payment by mistake or as otherwise provided for in the regulations.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 4</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[These Standards shall come into effect on the date of promulgation.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
</法規內容>
</法規>
